        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The Byzantines did not call themselves Byzantine. They called themselves:\n- **Rhomaioi** (Ῥωμαῖοι) — Romans\n- Their empire: **Βασιλεία τῶν Ῥωμαίων** (Basileia tōn Rhomaiōn) — Kingdom of the Romans\n- Their capital: Constantinople = New Rome"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-BYZANTINE-EMPIRE.md#012",
      "path": [
