        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Byzantine Empire - Eastern Rome, 330–1453",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "\"Byzantine\" is a historiographic term coined in 1557 by Hieronymus Wolf, using the old name for Constantinople (Byzantion/Byzantium). The Byzantines would find it bizarre."
    },
